    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLURA is a fiction game made with some adaptations based on real events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Story&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Me and Mike.James and Brick are experienced technical divers. Today we will set a world record by exploring the Pluragrotta underwater cave in Norway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But an unexpected tragic accident happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Game Features&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1st person 3D short horror game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fear of survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some key customization features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Playtime&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will take about an hour or more to see all the endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;<i><strong>Developer Story</strong></i>&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-man Development, Sixteen Years of Development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Video Content Guidelines&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and businesses can upload and broadcast videos without separate permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VVC GAMES is not liable for any damage caused by uploading and broadcasting game videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These guidelines are subject to change without prior notice.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLURA is a fiction game made with some adaptations based on real events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Story&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Me and Mike.James and Brick are experienced technical divers. Today we will set a world record by exploring the Pluragrotta underwater cave in Norway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But an unexpected tragic accident happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Game Features&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1st person 3D short horror game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fear of survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some key customization features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Playtime&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will take about an hour or more to see all the endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;<i><strong>Developer Story</strong></i>&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-man Development, Sixteen Years of Development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&lt;Video Content Guidelines&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both individuals and businesses can upload and broadcast videos without separate permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VVC GAMES is not liable for any damage caused by uploading and broadcasting game videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These guidelines are subject to change without prior notice.</p>",
